### IAM requests (phase 1). Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension and the IntelliJ HTTP client.
### Pick the environment, then run the requests in order.
@host = https://tarjepafi-api-pafi7k2.azurewebsites.net
# @host = http://localhost:8080
@origin = http://localhost:4200

### 1. Health (expect {"status":"UP",...})
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### 2. Sign in as a teacher (expect 200, token + user)
# @name signIn
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "docente@upc.edu.pe", "password": "Docente123*" }

###
@token = {{signIn.response.body.$.token}}

### 3. Current user (expect 200, role TEACHER)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Wrong password (expect 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "docente@upc.edu.pe", "password": "wrong" }

### 5. Not an institutional address (expect 400 INVALID_EMAIL)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "someone@gmail.com", "password": "x" }

### 6. Disabled account (expect 403 ACCOUNT_DISABLED)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "jsalazar@upc.edu.pe", "password": "Docente123*" }

### 7. Missing body field (expect 400 VALIDATION_FAILED with fields)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "docente@upc.edu.pe" }

### 8. No token (expect 401)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me

### 9. A teacher may not move the clock (expect 403)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/simulation/clock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "now": "2026-10-07T10:00:00" }

### 10. Read the clock (expect 200, simulated true on the demo)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/simulation/clock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. CORS preflight from the frontend origin (expect 200 and Access-Control-Allow-Origin)
OPTIONS {{host}}/api/v1/auth/sign-in
Origin: {{origin}}
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: content-type,authorization
